x453 text "3. Edit it"
x454 puts x452 x453
x455 call close x454 
x456 call open x455 2
x457 write x456 2
x458 text "Ask for a view with `a0 view hello.a0 affine`; it prints the function under a handle (e0) with its revision. Reply with the handle, then edits, one per line:"
x459 puts x457 x458
x460 call close x459 
x461 call open x460 10
x462 write x461 4
x463 write x462 2
x464 text "code"
x465 puts x463 x464
x466 call open x465 4
x467 write x466 2
x468 text "id op args           replace instruction id, or insert it before ret\n"
x469 puts x467 x468
x470 write x469 2
