x472 puts x470 x471
x473 write x472 2
x474 text "-id                  delete instruction id\n"
x475 puts x473 x474
x476 write x475 2
x477 text "ret x                change the result\n"
x478 puts x476 x477
x479 write x478 2
x480 text "fn ... end           add or replace a whole function (program handle g0)\n"
x481 puts x479 x480
x482 write x481 2
x483 text "-fn name             remove a function"
x484 puts x482 x483
x485 call close x484 
x486 call close x485 
x487 call open x486 2
x488 write x487 2
x489 text "The edit is applied only if it parses, type-checks and was written against the current revision. Otherwise it is rejected with a code and the one fix that resolves it, and the handle stays valid."
x490 puts x488 x489
x491 call close x490 
x492 call open x491 15
x493 write x492 2
